#: umc/js/top.js:71
msgid "Terminate"
msgstr "終止"

#: umc/js/top.js:64
msgid "This module generates an overview of all running processes. The search function can reduce the number of results. Specified processes can be selected and terminated. If a process can't be normally terminated (using SIGTERM signal), the termination can be forced (using SIGKILL signal)."
msgstr "此模組會產生所有執行中處理程序的總覽。搜尋功能可減少結果數量。可選取並終止指定的處理程序。如果處理程序無法正常終止 (使用 SIGTERM 訊號)，則可強制終止 (使用 SIGKILL 訊號)。"

